caption:
The image depicts an urban scene featuring several buildings and street elements. The primary focus is on a traffic sign mounted on a yellow pole, which has a red circular shape with a white border. Inside the circle, there is a black stick figure drawing of a person standing on a white line, indicating that pedestrians should not stand on the line. This type of sign is commonly used to prevent pedestrians from blocking the view of drivers.

In the background, there are three distinct buildings:

